

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@adminEmail = admin@polinema.ac.id
@adminPassword = Admin123!

### 1. LOGIN ADMIN -> 200, ada accessToken
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 2. CREATE tanpa token -> 401 atau 403 (tulis wajib login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/berita
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Berita Tanpa Login",
  "deskripsi": "Harus ditolak",
  "kategori": "Umum",
  "tanggal": "2026-11-03"
}

### 3. CREATE berita -> 201, ada id_berita dan slug
# Jika 409 (judul sudah dipakai), jalankan DELETE (nomor 9) dulu atau ganti judulnya.
# @name createBerita
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/berita
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Berita Uji Polinema",
  "deskripsi": "Ini adalah isi berita uji untuk tes CRUD.",
  "kategori": "Akademik",
  "tanggal": "2026-11-03"
}

###
@beritaId = {{createBerita.response.body.$.id_berita}}
@beritaSlug = {{createBerita.response.body.$.slug}}

### 4. CREATE data tidak lengkap (tanpa judul) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/berita
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deskripsi": "Tanpa judul",
  "kategori": "Umum",
  "tanggal": "2026-11-03"
}

### 5. READ semua berita (publik) -> 200, berisi "Berita Uji Polinema"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/berita

### 6. READ berdasarkan id -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/berita/id/{{beritaId}}

### 7. READ berdasarkan slug -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/berita/slug/{{beritaSlug}}

### 8. UPDATE berita -> 200, judul dan kategori berubah
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/berita/{{beritaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Berita Uji Polinema Revisi",
  "deskripsi": "Isi berita sudah diperbarui.",
  "kategori": "Kemahasiswaan",
  "tanggal": "2026-11-04"
}

### 8b. READ setelah update -> 200, data sudah berubah
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/berita/id/{{beritaId}}

### 9. DELETE berita -> 204 (tanpa isi)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/berita/{{beritaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. BUKTI DELETE: baca berita yang sudah dihapus -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/berita/id/{{beritaId}}
